# Basic GET and POST requests, no scripting involved.
#
# These hit a local httpbin instance so you can try them with zero cloud
# dependency -- run `make httpbin-up` from the repo root first (requires
# Docker), then `make httpbin-down` when you're done. See 2_scripting.http
# for pre-request/post-request scripting and a login -> token -> auth chain.

###
# @name Get
GET http://localhost:8080/get?greeting=hello HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

###
# @name Post
POST http://localhost:8080/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John",
  "greeting": "Hello"
}
